    "description": "Bingo City 75 is a famous free online BINGO and Vegas SLOT games for mobile and tablets. Play the BEST BINGO, SLOT and meet with worldwide players. Our 75 ball rooms offer everything any Bingo lover could ask for!\r\nYou'll find Huge JACKPOTS, tons of BONUSES, gorgeous GRAPHICS and all day BINGO at blitz speed. \r\nNew seasonal events are special. Get that benefit!\r\nWho is a jackpot winner? Today\u2019s winner will be you! Let\u2019s go bingo party!! Let\u2019s make your own way to a new bingo journey.\r\n\r\nEASY TO PLAY\r\nAs each number is called, find and match numbers on your card and click it. If your card matches for the pattern correctly, just call BINGO. EASY TO WIN! But be careful! If you call Bingo 2 times incorrectly, you will lose your card. Also, after the first player calls bingo, there will be 5 extra balls drawn to give everyone else a chance to get bingo.\r\n\r\nMULTIPLE CARDS\r\n1 bingo card is so old-skool. Play multiple bingo games at the same time!  Players can choose to play 1~8 bingo cards in bingo games. You can buy maximum 8 cards for playing.\r\n\r\nHOTTEST SLOTS\r\nBingo city 75 brings a totally a new game experience to bingo gamers. Those slots are monopoly. Every slot has unique wild. Also, new slots will be updated. Play slot! Spin that reels!\r\n\r\nFREE BONUSES!\r\nWhen you begin with a new story of bingo, you can get \u2018STARTING REWARD\u2019. There is daily bonus every day. Spin the daily bonus wheel and enjoy giveaways of extra game chips. You can win big prizes! Also, please open our store in game. You can get store bonus every 8 hours. Check your gift box now.\r\n\r\nVARIOUS BINGO PATTERNS\r\nWe have numerous kind of bingo patterns. You can enjoy those patterns with all around worldwide players. New patterns will be added.\r\n\r\nFREE AUTO DAUB\r\nDon\u2019t bother yourself to bash your number on bingo board! We offer Auto daub for free. When a number is called, we are auto-daubed your numbers at tickets for you. And also you can turn off auto-daubed. Then you should check the number on your card manually.\r\n\r\nGLOBAL PLAYERS\r\nThis is awesome multiplayer bingo game. You can play bingo together with live player at the same time. Global chat room is the hot spot to talk! Friendly bingo players are everywhere! Make international friends. But keep polite to talk with strangers\r\n\r\n\u203b Bingo city 75 contains optional in-app purchases.\r\n\u203b The games are intended for an adult audience.\r\n\u203b The games do not offer \"real money gambling\" or an opportunity to win real money or prizes.\r\n\u203b Practice or success at social casino gaming does not imply future success at \"real money gambling\".",
